clear
drop _all
clear matrix
clear mata
version 14.0 

set more off, permanently

* Set working directory
global basepath ".\your\path"      // change this to the path of the replication folder

* Call configuration file
do "${basepath}/config.do"

* Prepare analysis data sets
do "${basepath}/Prepare data.do"

* Analyse data sets
do "${basepath}/Analyse data.do"

